{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["犹大王乌西雅、约坦、亚哈斯和希西迦执政期间，亚摩斯的儿子以赛亚看到了以下有关犹大和耶路撒冷的异象。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝责备叛逆的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"诸天啊，请听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，要侧耳听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我把孩子抚育成人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们竟然背叛我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛认识主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驴也认得主人的槽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列却不认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民却不明白。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"唉！这罪恶的民族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶贯满盈的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作恶的子孙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"败坏的儿女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们背弃耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐视以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与祂疏远。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你们为什么一再叛逆？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为什么还要受责打？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们已经头破血流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"身心疲惫不堪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们已经体无完肤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从头到脚伤痕累累，尽是瘀肿和伤口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有清洗，没有包扎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有敷药。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你们的土地荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑化为灰烬。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们亲眼目睹自己的田园被外族人侵吞、毁坏、变成不毛之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仅存的少女锡安也像葡萄园里的草棚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像瓜田中的茅舍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像被困无援的孤城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是万军之耶和华让我们一些人存活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们早就像所多玛和蛾摩拉一样灭亡了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们这些所多玛的首领啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聆听耶和华的话！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些蛾摩拉的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要侧耳听我们上帝的训诲！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们献上许多祭物，对我有什么用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我厌烦公绵羊的燔祭和肥畜的脂肪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不喜欢公牛、羊羔和公山羊的血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“你们来朝见我的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁要求你们带着这些来践踏我的院宇呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要再带毫无意义的祭物了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憎恶你们烧的香。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我无法容忍你们又作恶又举行庄严的聚会，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你们的朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"、安息日和大会。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憎恶你们的朔日及各种节期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们成了我的重担，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令我厌倦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们举手祷告，我必掩面不理。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你们祷告再多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不会听，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们双手沾满鲜血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要洗净自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让我再看见你们的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要停止作恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要学习行善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求正义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帮助受欺压的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"替孤儿辩护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为寡妇申冤。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“来吧，我们彼此理论！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪虽如朱红，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必洁白如雪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪虽如绯红，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必白如羊毛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们愿意听从，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必享用这地方的美好出产。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们执意叛逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必丧身刀下。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲口说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信的城竟变成了妓女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从前充满公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是公义之家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在却住着凶手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的银子变为渣滓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的美酒掺了水分。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的首领是叛逆之徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与盗贼为伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"个个喜爱贿赂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贪图好处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不为孤儿辩护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不替寡妇申冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"所以，主——万军之耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的大能者说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“唉！我要向我的敌人报仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我的仇敌雪恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必出手攻击你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用碱炼净你的渣滓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除尽你的杂质。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必像从前一样恢复你的审判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像起初一样恢复你的谋士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"之后，你必被称为公义之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信之邑。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"耶和华必因祂的公正救赎锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因祂的公义拯救城中悔改的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但叛逆之辈和犯罪之徒必同遭毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背弃耶和华的人必灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必因所喜爱的圣橡树而抱愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因所选择的偶像园而蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必像叶子枯萎的橡树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如无水的园子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有权势的人像麻绒，他的行为如火花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"两者要一同焚毁，无人能救。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“朔日”即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/SNG/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}